{"category":"medallions","description":"Unsere Medaillons werden aus Bronze gefertigt und mit handgemachten Stempeln unter glühender Hitze geprägt. Sie können vergoldet, gefärbt, verzinnt oder unbehandelt bleiben – auch Kombinationen sind möglich. Auf Wunsch gestalten wir Medaillons und Stempel individuell, um einzigartige Motive zu kreieren.","custom":"Auch Ihre eigenen Ideen können wir umsetzen, einen personalisierten Stempel bauen und Ihr ganz persönliches Medallion prägen.","images":["assets/source/95f73af1148deeb8cbd7.jpg","assets/source/1485bd1b9d970a1eb019.jpg","assets/source/6df5ff821d2b4575d9db.jpg","assets/source/7d5b09551336c78e5caf.jpg","assets/source/531bf4302aedf84881e4.jpg","assets/source/8e43a615de05e8b90b4b.jpg","assets/source/822e5737359e258719fc.jpg","assets/source/9d043ecc19c58f14c1bc.jpg","assets/source/0f74ece2f0fe88c5e739.jpg","assets/source/95e3ccda416afd49615c.jpg","assets/source/ebecb91fb8c028fd6685.jpg","assets/source/a943c4c80e1a4d216831.jpg","assets/source/8854cfcb3c905cf62775.jpg","assets/source/6effae22a5a2d98d8a3d.jpg","assets/source/49c67e45d9d556c0c0ed.jpg","assets/source/8b31f4ed2842eb5e5560.jpg","assets/source/431c2b0539df471a2e21.jpg","assets/source/17df6d649e2ce5cc5d4d.jpg","assets/source/de647ef46a91883891b2.jpg","assets/source/9da5a686558edb9eb670.jpg","assets/source/40480bfb2cab61b3746f.jpg","assets/source/383131af3a13f5f39969.jpg","assets/source/6218775c06eeb5eb46a2.jpg","assets/source/2d5fee18a040b7ac73c0.jpg","assets/source/b50084ee2d6cad91e64b.jpg","assets/source/e7e00cc05ece81da79d4.jpg","assets/source/23342a58196dfa458e2b.jpg","assets/source/a3988663b01b44cadbac.jpg","assets/source/5efc7ca42aa85326bafb.jpg","assets/source/4aeca34c7f8e5407b0fd.jpg","assets/source/53f077ce6f50c97a6c03.jpg","assets/source/e84d4064d3c54e354408.jpg","assets/source/d96fb9392f0d79733910.jpg","assets/source/d1a795679a35d11c416d.jpg","assets/source/6973ada6ce0bcf017ff5.jpg","assets/source/63f96913807a16381b8d.jpg","assets/source/0785c58eff1e82bb